# Both of these are OPTIONAL. The app works fully without them, using local
# calculation (Ask Your Data) and showing Google Sheets as "not configured".

# Set this to enable a real Google OAuth "Connect Google Sheets" flow.
# Requires a Google Cloud project with the Sheets API enabled.
# VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

# Set this to a backend endpoint that forwards questions to an LLM, to let
# "Ask Your Data" fall back to a real model for questions the local engine
# doesn't recognize. Never put a raw LLM API key directly in this file —
# it would ship to every visitor's browser.
# VITE_AI_API_ENDPOINT=
